557,"line_no":98250,"gurmukhi":"ਕੁਥਪੇਣ ਥਪੰ ॥੫੫॥","translit_en":"kuthapen thapa(n) ||55||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"They will recite the evil mantras and will establish the uncivilised notions.55."},"pu":{"ss":"ਮਾੜੀਆਂ ਸਥਾਪਨਾਵਾ ਕਰਨਗੇ ॥੫੫॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9184,"next":9186}}